\\"[00:00:00-00:00:03] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：星空、水面、方形石台、男子；动作：男子坐在石台上；镜头变化：从远景缓慢推近，展现星空下的水面与石台；声音：空灵悠远的古风配乐，伴随轻微的环境底噪\\\",\\n  \\\"[00:00:03-00:00:08] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：男子、烛台、石桌、刻字工具；动作：男子伏案在烛火旁，手持刻刀准备刻写；镜头变化：继续推近，聚焦男子的上半身与桌面；声音：空灵悠远的古风配乐，伴随轻微的环境底噪\\\",\\n  \\\"[00:00:08-00:00:12] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：刻刀、石片、刻好的符号；动作：特写刻刀在石片上雕刻，石片上出现发光的符号；镜头变化：特写刻刀与石片的细节；声音：空灵悠远的古风配乐，伴随刻刀与石片摩擦的细微声响\\\",\\n  \\\"[00:00:12-00:00:15] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：男子、石台；动作：男子抬头望向星空；镜头变化：拉回至全景，展现男子静坐于石台上的整体场景；声音：空灵悠远的古风配乐，伴随轻微的环境底噪\\\"\\n}\",\"render_task_id\":\"54694376204\",\"cover_url\":\"https://p9-sign.douyinpic.com/everphoto-jianying-assets/oMZB49BoI2fKKxUBffVO71gCuQmwadsRAmSaGz~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1792933384\\u0026l=2026102520581758F7F4236198459C0A23\\u0026x-expires=1808485399\\u0026x-signature=hSZe%2Bt53ez%2FgcYSvo%2FwzvQBZEI8%3D\",\"music_meta\":null,\"preview_url\":\"https://v26-xyq-video.jianying.com/c05ca7e0e57add63b034f144c42f6149/6bcb4c17/video/n/everphoto-jianying-assets/6800b005225e47cba0e7fa422c38e541/?a=795647\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=6284\\u0026bt=6284\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=TLtriUeR_yygZmo0PiYmXgkVQ9w6x\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=M3lkZWlvOjN5ZTczNDlmM0BpM3lkZWlvOjN5ZTczNDlmM0BuYi1eYWFecGJhLS1kNGFzYSNuYi1eYWFecGJhLS1kNGFzcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=80000e00010000\\u0026dy_q=1792933384\\u0026l=2026102520581758F7F4236198459C0A23\",\"render_task_status\":null,\"draft_key\":null,\"package_id\":null,\"vid\":null,\"render_rsp_map\":{\"disable_edit\":\"1\",\"watermark_version\":\"2\"},\"download_url\":\"https://v11-xyq-video.jianying.com/22cea6b72551ae05fb04a368ba7d9fbe/6bcb4c17/video/n/everphoto-jianying-assets/5da6a1107f5748ad9b78452bd936b5f1/?a=795647\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=4522\\u0026bt=4522\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=TLtriUeR_yygZmo0PiYmXgkVQ9w6x\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=anJ5aTVvOjN5ZTczNDlmM0BpanJ5aTVvOjN5ZTczNDlmM0BqXjUxYWFmcGJhLS1kNGFzYSNqXjUxYWFmcGJhLS1kNGFzcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=80